        "estimatedBytes": 102956,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "175412057b72dd6ac2bb51fe44c131eba0aa40ce2098ebbdd1ef127f92446daa",
        "speechText": "「たんぼへかかったね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "35ca450b2bd1f0f56fe4547b4b2fc00b927c75d856ba68392c611c4d2e373cc4",
        "candidateIds": [
          "3JTeUGxNns5LN0f6_w--zu09rGgyI-PJAOnlfY9jaO4"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 46844,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "5b8bdf10287bfafd78429877ccf058150965c1b2a2c7bc9b152e11020f2fc156",
        "speechText": "「ふふん」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "3ed837523b59f86966b1d89202f3b55dce569f5e575a6256e3125a76bc69c66c",
        "candidateIds": [
          "hLBRDwIiB1ycXEAcF0Ipx5je3pIU6O5GBn5Ki9njJV4"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 149756,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "83c05331e66de5c1d0fbc33d20f0493fbd4e44587f799d635d7dee39dea48434",
        "speechText": "「何がって、知ってるじゃないか」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "41b9bc98948e08665afbbba6f74c3a79067ee2aaac2259c3c422ba37bf2b2932",
        "candidateIds": [
          "-I3F5_i4k0bSY4K5pJySgbHPA9RwRlOjbsa67jln6LQ"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 84284,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "535a4e14b0f7a49352c81a36f8687f2e222a83c1bebb934127bb6e16d4aa935f",
        "speechText": "「左が好いだろう」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "51ec42d7fc4d404229f815c0216a94a32c777a82a338f3ff090925fa597f3d23",
        "candidateIds": [
          "p9X4qD4KycJLi6KNEdifxhhDIetPu9QRoC5Uw6hlA90"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 177836,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "ab882b119f0d4a44ef1972162b53848e5dea1de688f61cb997984849bb260933",
        "speechText": "「おとっさん、その杉の根の処だったね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "578b47f06e592c0eab2c4654d43803c48ee36ab66a0936d49c19c0ad56b7e996",
        "candidateIds": [
          "G2rPtY8XRULbPJ1vsIjm9LgBN2HXgF4Jacej6ObkGRo"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 327500,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "85aaf471ddfc6284e6f5843d1e3a95bcc53592e01b73aacccb7df49d38b049ad",
        "speechText": "「こうしておくと、箱の中でへびになる。今に見せてやる。今に見せてやる」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "59d51239c941fe83e59eac829c10458440bfde4e9aaeedb436e094feee33d03b",
        "candidateIds": [
          "S0osbiQVfxsu4588Y83Fm-RL-qljo7AN0CCvPjwggVg"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 84284,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "2b2f991aed9a2290cb4be42a01332643fc03deed61f4f88f65f3a7df541ea2fc",
        "speechText": "「どこへ行くかね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "5ee8f1e20ee1e40cd90a9ead5370295c22e02bd5d3b9a2e56b90c480080be077",
        "candidateIds": [
          "RXDlARWzZUi7lHP4hTwuAJnzwEJhQobP7UDAJZo6JNc"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 196508,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "f9e9d1a56fa43cb4f89b0ed6945128652e8da8844433175a2b928a4043f619d2",
        "speechText": "「好い子だから、少しのま、待っておいでよ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "66a1afb3ace1b2312e648d50ae7ff709f5148802bf9159a0fa01182424f8aba2",
        "candidateIds": [
          "89cTLLhcO7Ki5xWZvofIr2OhSRVtF4aEd_qfwi_G18g"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 131036,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "36d29ad4854ed21b4b310bae5d3d12383903cd0b554d9c3d4bc1a6726b3138d1",
        "speechText": "「百年はもう来ていたんだな」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "7127e6971c678879f99a00310a2a9b2e5c9a903f0493186ec78d191ce60b2978",
        "candidateIds": [
          "9MPlH28eWyUQVIZ2QGWPe80uWmcFvhRZcsv09c73OuU"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 785900,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "8c1511ebab357dab1bbcbe57e5c5c10a2ecdec0d96503f61d243b14886a023a4",
        "speechText": "「死んだら、うめて下さい。大きな真珠貝で穴を掘って。そうして天から落ちて来る星のかけをはかじるしに置いて下さい。そうして墓の傍に待っていて下さい。またあいに来ますから」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "714c0abf853d1e99d95ff568054112faca873442302cf3df27a87c6a7e7856e1",
        "candidateIds": [
          "Su69JFtf-46zCX7CZgpIfRXZxRnz7-Y9cYP8pMN7MjI"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 224588,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "71d64cd5950e8b3c77a5164d79ba0d16ffc396dd9434b7d347cb239878d828e1",
        "speechText": "「今になる、蛇になる、 きっとなる、笛が鳴る、」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "721c2120a690596d005d00dcf446667ea1915a8fa5753ac2a08c33f033bcd0b3",
        "candidateIds": [
          "zv1zYkOUdHyOSJAsL5vuPXJcdF0GQepXmH9XMKDLa0o"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 233948,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "fc7fbb2ab7cdbe032572b345cf5e9c8e2db6c7945e76fd837eb1dea848b88607",
        "speechText": "「御前がおれを殺したのは今からちょうど百年前だね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "78c3ef0312b45c36da3dc37dbe76d4127b384c1b95b4effde3eca5ba047f3a40",
        "candidateIds": [
          "sjPa02gUZVGgmmNY0PN9pIAGnlc4JHXjuLlULPrQdEs"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 56204,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "60c35d7ac1c64594568123fa7a73f7787b27ad341f849c683da4ac3d233cbc8a",
        "speechText": "「御父様は」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "79740c7f15c744ac2b947fc7e7c03daa5b828a127b30f461dac669bed0007ea0",
        "candidateIds": [
          "pXERW8UIbgCMjDdszQ833nKuSnroDqmE7AphTrh5Lo8"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 56204,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "ab80128a1ebc9ba170393dccd427fc121a5cb124ffd2a2919dccf1afa3721441",
        "speechText": "「今になる」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "7fae839a23329cf5ed31a0179c581276ad831dd90c43ce7ff3ea25bd33588e8c",
        "candidateIds": [
          "pDow8sz5xmwwM9OECuU4n6d5vPdjmIKPFZz7Jrs4ngo"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 177836,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "c1a0b5d8cfbc55e74574ab18e86cb8af5723ab96947813a5cce9f84bef2089c3",
        "speechText": "「だんなは表の金魚売を御覧なすったか」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "895839ac9bbf5ed2f46718017154e179b80eec97341cfb0e7a7058c615ba85dd",
        "candidateIds": [
          "KQD_XGglvL1O14ilMz948jYinjEeY6Pt9NKAHLUSq0o"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 486524,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "03b5a9c804608731771567c2826521ff3e18b9d5fa98a0016635f42389c571ae",
        "speechText": "「へえ仁王だね。今でも仁王をほるのかね。へえそうかね。わっしゃまた仁王はみんな古いのばかりかと思ってた」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "960e654703e84190bd9c28840b69826fadca748d2d5e4fe143adb442092d06fa",
        "candidateIds": [
          "-j3kKlvEzNgFPPcyzdskfLZW9hf3KihxOoIggu-I3yE"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 102956,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "4f6576ef8660b9b4a3b9699589c42ca4f90177bbdaa24049f55629db0cb97881",
        "speechText": "「遠慮しないでもいい」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "995ea79a17cb4d6225c40905713958a11373f330d7377428e4c61620c7e3c97e",
        "candidateIds": [
          "d8zqBqtjKl7CrYGDWDfuOoHrBYNUdVxiC9lHtdOXmEo"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 74924,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "b7ab7b289ceb3a4438268f58265c7575444e44b9f248695d66d9397a170f34b0",
        "speechText": "「へその奥だよ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "9d58c46f2e9e93ccf8c67cb67e7e8d89ff9eb0844c9f230d4f631f237f7c6968",
        "candidateIds": [
          "iUNVvLO1IjLgxozRPzDmVobhOv1iMlEG3pjelxkc7EQ"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 467852,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "b31b70c969189d6fd4197e07614460d465e86e886a0e52772867a456cf3645cf",
        "speechText": "「さすがは運慶だな。眼中に我々なしだ。天下の英雄はただ仁王とわれとあるのみと云う態度だ。あっぱれだ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "9ec3da00abc1bde4bc6d93ffb96e0208ff0b3dfc096b4191d86d61bfb52df637",
        "candidateIds": [
          "-8QhqVTEuNYe2aGISaGML7m46M77NCaltmhBoJM4b6Q"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 56204,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "d2402823e61dd42b3308c84291a6a8e3f434d34a00a5ceca5e386962345d2c34",
        "speechText": "「蛇になる」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "a34aaaa366681ad6111a9c01586ae9daf86c4df47bd13ad2ce2604318c94ac38",
        "candidateIds": [
          "OB9pGh3djiav4BKZWIBtgGIhPQ_Qd9hwLSzZ877LrUE"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 168476,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "012084345be078287b436728d99840a7db87dd7b318f8fd2c38a9b4fe227f6f3",
        "speechText": "「落ちて行く日を追かけるようだから」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "a34ce6ac787a499c4856f9afa7beb695332eea7429742fb6d736f8e615035123",
        "candidateIds": [
          "d94x27hCPvNvgPbVkEdFCE59H9hUaAa1DQtqQ2fsioA"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 37484,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "b70b02c98d3f4c116731660d381a76234e39f8644690a90db6ce9697dd51c9e0",
        "speechText": "「なぜ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "a560d88a4ea8c0d289d20cd1851b7fd9550aaeb13882530e92dfb5d77c302f0c",
        "candidateIds": [
          "zADWC9-m6rJaiNAss3pRSkivT85ySqWtOefX0LwYRIw"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 205868,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "879bd5162b2ca75d69f634e8525125df7f210d82d1642d962aed73e5d26e7aa7",
        "speechText": "「ここだ、ここだ。ちょうどその杉の根の処だ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "ad60d0ff13fced0cb520283f7e6e3d3bb52afd3cfacf5fc98feb432e00635a06",
        "candidateIds": [
          "zcmj2uI9mY_QB5x2s4pPF_MjCK3bSLv9A8tSmuhKA7I"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 74924,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "e4e03a7be73a7b80e6b058259ad1c5e950aaf28990097f07bd86b736899b8194",
        "speechText": "「何を笑うんだ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b23abaa2f2b276be8c1d40810c940cd49309922f80aa3ebca1cd11f914f18f9c",
        "candidateIds": [
          "nyQlIxkQvoSPspGi8Z5v65UrMm5uvXwpigypjnJLGZE"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 112316,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "5cff8887f8a3f1fc341b2f60ec448cab8b8cc20e60ff18a66d1bc084969ad9e9",
        "speechText": "「百年待っていて下さい」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b3e6384d38de472be21dfe408ff51156031091c6192a0eef5f5e5eabce207cf5",
        "candidateIds": [
          "ZGbM5Yd80W4sfON8OHHpSzm__cIyToPTN-nSaoFKFbw"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 74924,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "0c38bc1da0e81e230a3cd5e5ff07130c8cf5497ac3ca459eb6919013c8dfcca3",
        "speechText": "「まっすぐかい」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b482a22a5dad371d0abb1986c2fe8216d513512a466dfa764e0ed39bca204665",
        "candidateIds": [
          "F7FAn6-zYiAQ0oAe5cJQyvnX9GHw2rZHZir2jQ6aTEk"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 112316,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "070dc2d4f09c343bc12e367791f7db0da0536b7de5534e06e321f4f9c2e7856b",
        "speechText": "「御爺さんはいくつかね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b5fa1ee0ebe5c5f5ca609aaf7009901452d9d9b7cd3ad865da5ee72ca46271c5",
        "candidateIds": [
          "Su_6wzanYiGgEvGqWyjZp_FGOV6LbxCRLPMiPo8gq6o"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 187196,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "c9e3e10a6e2bbf2e190518dc5a40951cab52bd0f14a3bc67d43e82b8b35357ff",
        "speechText": "「だからおぶってやるからいいじゃないか」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b6d5a8c9ab2884c5867d1598f92e3d9abc80f0a03e9aaba50f0f8262597f4173",
        "candidateIds": [
          "7mRcWhS1mxZu-ftpt6zTCl3UQvLfnhq1iX107dcMMH4"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 93644,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "103d90b212734aa8d70e758d7e3f59feb198698148c5a9f0bc8930d1ac084a0e",
        "speechText": "「いくつか忘れたよ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b6e4cc3fb1065e87f46c69a337c6de4985ca5f62e1eea51064cb654ea394c246",
        "candidateIds": [
          "O0XFE_bOAD6ia9jEILa8BL2LAjtFSJFOJCdvejvNIuA"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 327500,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "99035f41c032d1871904a32e7905980f8e40d7700b161d487e2eb1617faf44b0",
        "speechText": "「百年、私の墓のそばに坐って待っていて下さい。きっと逢いに来ますから」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b7b7d417bcbc77bfe6975ce33475127a53bcc6f3aa1ca1f9892279dd62bb3c22",
        "candidateIds": [
          "LQMKnowDBh3WK8RYSLOXC7NyMGo0U5syotNf84iKvJk"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 84284,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "d2ead7a85db8fe57cc3583a71bd43604ca197426858ad1204b7b79a385ad18a0",
        "speechText": "「あっちへ行くよ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "b80ddda0cddaec0fc5018d2489091e2fe069ade6bccea8e9005235bd1ec5a746",
        "candidateIds": [
          "lh36g3rtpWGBLOgdI-BQJhT_1gS-Tl3ufNLWNj7QNfg"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 65564,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "e939a60fbb53327a82f4d678987a69ea5cc6529e401331e288429ad275f37ca6",
        "speechText": "「いつ御帰り」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "bfba4b685210a8f0e99fdaa4ed7f5cd925d0bcd7e38022eaa306c6fdfe0aad25",
        "candidateIds": [
          "sLYZF63dHtiFW1T8vbPndW2IpLat2CPhU3kxNOBVi5M"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 131036,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "490c75b8482527b866af9957ad683d3f81bae713fd2096ce1917ec3cbac04c15",
        "speechText": "「この船は西へ行くんですか」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "c86eb11b55df6063eea02c7b35fd85abedb63daebce0a10f7335b193ce62dcdf",
        "candidateIds": [
          "DLKJcN2UdSkQ4-Q4Z4rtD09ms1o06ylnrQgjSzxcOvM"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 290108,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "9bf5a85e0fd1c2a8f06b1765d579a258e0987fdfa838af4d3293720f6302e63d",
        "speechText": "「あの鑿と槌の使い方を見たまえ。だいじざいの妙境に達している」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "cbe4bcdba90da5a51744aef4119046e674386531b8a976ff1947429500440296",
        "candidateIds": [
          "4t3_WePhl5o0Iin8wZ_zKr7495jCsxSWoTg7SAcGVCk"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 131036,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "9debb81a344572b032affc1042b8d46e64b081069cce69f2eb007d733990a661",
        "speechText": "「御爺さんのうちはどこかね」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "ccad8b434b18103955b3bb42be4df288af8eb8e2e3fdd75938847b2d6b3f67a6",
        "candidateIds": [
          "JBjA9c6xXXPbV63URxjyWm_rpMrh70L3E7h4SgO0Sig"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 37484,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "ecef301cb04d76d6a410b33854f5e722c5d35cd31ba57e0199df2518842aade4",
        "speechText": "「何が」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "ce2c4cfa0584f447e19ad3be4264bdbd210a38c5c58588a215c4f30ba50eeb4e",
        "candidateIds": [
          "QRfwDXFJhaqNsK1nAPIf6JFkAJR6YarrWTZicep1jqM"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 879452,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "b6ec70f4af99f79c77cbe91fca9bcc561d3e1a25f2fcf4bcaaf750aab897b700",
        "speechText": "「なに、あれは眉や鼻を鑿で作るんじゃない。あの通りの眉や鼻が木の中にうまっているのを、のみとつちの力で掘り出すまでだ。まるで土の中から石を掘り出すようなものだからけっして間違うはずはない」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "d3773e32b0b99128540b816a4a8242d70d89bac7609a7a2b9a25c5ba5ea368f9",
        "candidateIds": [
          "yJuhw-ZlbvyT-n9yVQAfBQ9kcQXEFqpeJhBJnmqKxQ0"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 37484,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "785bc82580c50934bf11e46bb3c0aaaf4879f461e18e77210b16ec3cc1e923ce",
        "speechText": "「今に」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "d826cc903ad4edfaa2b9f09b9ef11ce521c0ec00da32b5e98a41177b32f84440",
        "candidateIds": [
          "_8S218eY_QRHqRyghZImj-gAesMeJ95_sUdgukDBwlM"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 121676,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "7c549dd22b84b3dced176de20b15a7e850595ad10dd1b8ab86409c6c0fd5bccc",
        "speechText": "「石が立ってるはずだがな」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "dcb4e5418625ff5fc501a647cd51f359ba6e212bc07e7bddb7cc0e9f013da3b5",
        "candidateIds": [
          "HRSpRhUZQTjmfja16wKtcA-n2lrxH5bFmWZBCcXT9NA"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 84284,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "1f3a505d7b7ea8d5041aad80cc2caa2f5fd5566b621aad940339e8fde26da714",
        "speechText": "「今に重くなるよ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "e1e361df54ea24cab91beaeb849e559747532888cfd6ebb1adbae36b7c432114",
        "candidateIds": [
          "ttEnW2XR7MTZAsMQr-UCkMCTTpi9fT67KY4mGCU1ojk"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 121676,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "f24628d15165eafac39b51a061bff63863cab5336e666cd68305ff206fdbe08c",
        "speechText": "「文化五年たつどしだろう」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "e63c36f502b4c1c565bb912e038fd74b6fe9f3a89a1cf994e9a3c953550d3bba",
        "candidateIds": [
          "AzRcMHbBRwDmuCAtEjviHGF4BEY9q25cNEgLRI10p-I"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 168476,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "c2c06174e850b3410fa30e3ef04cb0357ce3a29d4054716c17fc292d2f2565c1",
        "speechText": "「深くなる、夜になる、 真直になる」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "e93b7c7d7bf139a6465137bb0e8ef3b80f1f7c6a398d91a0791348a372a2557d",
        "candidateIds": [
          "iYBdsDHujKhhzfJnp4CbX-wRv5Xk4us953jmTA9cJLI"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 327500,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "4d043c40d0e8ca822ea5868fe1e6432c5d8e0819f2cb86222ab835adeba4ef1a",
        "speechText": "「よくああむぞうさに鑿を使って、思うようなまみえや鼻ができるものだな」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "ee922b018cebce85ab2595299959e1e3ec170c1f685f3f57d1c4f24f31123918",
        "candidateIds": [
          "yzjDtE6sTYWJ7u3HCm57e1j9IF7obDSqjUNiti_2o5U"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 74924,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "da1f41d33220647fda3f59bc975aede6f715a9616268f56620af14e13243a340",
        "speechText": "「うん、そうだ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "eef91fd148602e52f892b027a7d8de750aaf21e29b7c728e1e7e18ee48e4885a",
        "candidateIds": [
          "xSsrSYhwoKKf-iTgaFS4KDCqh4-IpTIVOgYZSh6h5jc"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 860780,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "13f18c6df2202fd08e79fc78c7f4cb79cabf5afb51a0bdcbe2c71b871818173c",
        "speechText": "「日が出るでしょう。それから日が沈むでしょう。それからまた出るでしょう、そうしてまた沈むでしょう。――赤い日が東から西へ、東から西へと落ちて行くうちに、――あなた、待っていられますか」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "ef93747021022cf58c0af26762346e11d9f06b4cd0cbaaa85aa5fe1126c1354e",
        "candidateIds": [
          "kedCuu7dGqfEtqoknQYQAqbo28JQXIKmXuqqhkKpUhY"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 570764,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "925cd7907fa143101a53e1c010717c13e0dde43de8ee6b6e7e7b7b6238bea9aa",
        "speechText": "「西へ行く日の、はては東か。それはほんまか。ひがし出る日の、おさとは西か。それも本真か。身は波の上。かじまくら。流せ流せ」"
      },
      {
        "action": "generate",
        "audioId": "f2a4a6361c49d8f20126a05677b8ce5b5c664e4fd6207c1f37b23fa74b2c2ef0",
        "candidateIds": [
          "LS3o3GVPfGeopWzqb_Nf3y0sTahJHebzjzwNImwtdaQ"
        ],
        "estimatedBytes": 74924,
        "existing": null,
        "speechSha256": "8db2a6b61b440efe23d81e7fc6cd4b4e50ecf655e2e0f60c52307c5459632449",
        "speechText": "「どうして解る」"
      }
    ],
